# Deploy after changes

**Do not deploy to production automatically.** Git is disconnected from Vercel. The user promotes in Vercel after reviewing and merging PRs.

- Do **not** run `vercel --prod` or `git push origin main` as part of a task.
- Only push feature branches and open PRs. The user will merge and promote when ready.
